# Vitalik's QAP example - all private inputs
# Prove: u^3 + u + 5 = 35 (without revealing u)
# From: https://medium.com/@VitalikButerin/quadratic-arithmetic-programs-from-zero-to-hero-f6d558cea649

decl private u

# Flatten u^3: sym_1 = u * u (u^2)
sym_1 = u * u

# y = sym_1 * u (u^3)
y = sym_1 * u

# Compute u^3 + u
sym_2 = y + u

# Compute u^3 + u + 5
out = sym_2 + 5

# Enforce out == 35
thirty_five = 35
check = out == thirty_five
